      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah this is awkard. Corentin\u0027s comment in the other thread was:\n\n\u003e We should probably add a getter on the DeviceBase for that. (eventually all these const getters with no params should really be in a \"Device Properties\" struct).\n\nFWIW we used to precompute the configs and cache them which would avoid having to re-enumerate them here, but had to change that because of NVIDIA\u0027s f16 issues. Maybe in the future when NVIDIA can support f16 properly we can go back to that approach.",
