      "writtenOn": "2025-11-19T21:31:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As a first pass, I double looped these to at least get something working. The other option would be to loop over one of them and convert into a `unordered_set` and then do a key lookup instead of a loop. Not sure if it\u0027s worth the effort as I assume these will be a small number of elements?",
      "revId": "544e4a251487d4bf9174e55ceb8783429c8de657",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
